  1841.0 ? relay1=nc relay2=nc relay3=nc relay4=nc relay5=nc relay6=nc outLamp1=off outLamp2=off outLamp3=off indLamp4=off indLamp5=off indLamp6=off  "MINIVAC is programmed so that if pushbuttons 1, 2 or 3 are pushed separately lights 1, 2 or 3 respectively will come on. However, if two or three pushbuttons are pushed simultaneously, the computer will remember them in association. Once any combination of pushbuttons has been pushed, the computer will turn on all associated lights whenever any one of the associated pushbuttons is pushed. MINIVAC will remember the association until instructed to forget it."
